NSView.displayLink(target:selector:) (macOS 14) drives every frame. On macOS 11 it's BigSurCompat's
CompatDisplayLink, a CVDisplayLink that sends step to the view on the main thread; it follows the window's screen
through followScreen, which NSView's link did by itself.

diff --git a/LightTouchMac/UI/DisplayView.swift b/LightTouchMac/UI/DisplayView.swift
index 7f8588a7..e54e3d7f 100644
